ial recognition feature, HoloMon also recognizes the real world.\nIf you nod or make a hand sign, HoloMon will respond to you.\nEnjoy your life with HoloMon.", "short_description": "This is an application to make friends with the mixed reality pet \"HolographicMonster(HoloMon)\".\nThe goal is to live with HoloMon in the real world and raise him to be a big monster.\nYou can give HoloMon food, play with a ball, and so on."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverSquare_1440x1440_1-1.png", "id": "9172328979490389", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570293_9172328986157055_8670910801304381989_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=74mD7XJ6Tp4Q7kNvwFAVpgp&_nc_oc=Adp-dmznIRBx3udkEv0B1YSOLXICXt35mSOJGhHUzFWEwx3J9tuLYrDLDLq9C9_i_L8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLmr0xWdbgaCIHUOH5zyqTnM3dwCc8AHpSVB4YvCj-wg&oe=6B045846"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_10-3.png", "id": "2288044464904587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982472_2288044468237920_89714264810729936_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pPIDg8pScN4Q7kNvwH2gzoe&_nc_oc=AdpSK8aYDrRgHLFvVU0Kygwo7VXFBQmI_8DBPBsFhIqiUzPrFi8h0FqwMRNvGApsfAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVDZx1EZyHJ6gFwVMnXul8gHfI-0KRHmIrTOxV2nuXNQ&oe=6B0478E0"}, {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_16-9.png", "id": "1819020505602835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982637_1819020508936168_3095875184930134309_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gNubQDDOsGwQ7kNvwHh67MX&_nc_oc=AdrWtodGXp5RI-km4zpdH7LY5zo-CkR3k_FMebbttrnuY2UQZwx7bYNXXlY8TbWXZjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-VvBMoDjJ8ogF1-0GyQR5D1mjZ0IoKEPyEoFOVpG5eg&oe=6B045F51"}, {